local wheelName="ReforgedEnhancementsPreviewWheel_"..tostring(App):gsub("[^%w]","")
App.Lifecycle:Defer(function() Actions:UnbindAction(wheelName) end)
Actions:BindActionAtPriority(wheelName,function()
    if not App.alive then return Enum.ContextActionResult.Pass end
    local mouse=Input:GetMouseLocation()
    for _,target in ipairs({window,popup,overlay}) do
        if target and target.Visible then local p,s=target.AbsolutePosition,target.AbsoluteSize
            if mouse.X>=p.X and mouse.X<=p.X+s.X and mouse.Y>=p.Y and mouse.Y<=p.Y+s.Y then return Enum.ContextActionResult.Sink end
        end
    end
    return Enum.ContextActionResult.Pass
end,false,Enum.ContextActionPriority.High.Value+1,Enum.UserInputType.MouseWheel)
